    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smashshot is a twin stick shooter with focus on knockback and inspiration from platform fighters. Rack up damage then blast your opponents off the screen</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >10+ ABILITIES AND WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select two from a foray of abilities and pair them with your favored weapon to cater to different p[aystyles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROUGELIKE PVE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a series of objectives leading up to the final stage. Purchase abilities and weapon upgrades along the way. And prove your skill in the final stage and defeat 1 of 5(?) bosses. Can be played alone or in couch co-op with up to 6 players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENGAGING PVP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a weapon and two abilities, one for utility, and one to knock your enemies away when the time is right. Up to<strong> 9</strong> players at a time!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smashshot is a twin stick shooter with focus on knockback and inspiration from platform fighters. Rack up damage then blast your opponents off the screen</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >10+ ABILITIES AND WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select two from a foray of abilities and pair them with your favored weapon to cater to different p[aystyles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROUGELIKE PVE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a series of objectives leading up to the final stage. Purchase abilities and weapon upgrades along the way. And prove your skill in the final stage and defeat 1 of 5(?) bosses. Can be played alone or in couch co-op with up to 6 players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENGAGING PVP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a weapon and two abilities, one for utility, and one to knock your enemies away when the time is right. Up to<strong> 9</strong> players at a time!</p>",
